[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
[b]The Morgenroete and Tech & Res patches still match stable 1.1.6. Do not use them with 1.2.0-beta.1.[/b]
[list]
[*]Using CMF? Add the [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3839275348]CMF patch[/url] and load it last.
[*]Using Morgenroete? Add the [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3839705018]Morgenroete patch[/url]. Disable the old Speculative Markets+Morgenroete patch.
[*]Using Tech & Res? Its [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3841713072]compatibility patch[/url] also covers Morgenroete's goods. With CMF, load CMF, Tech & Res, Speculative Markets - Beta, the Tech & Res patch, then the CMF patch.
[/list]
With CMF and Morgenroete, load [b]CMF > Morgenroete > Speculative Markets - Beta > Morgenroete patch > CMF patch.[/b]

[h2]Reporting problems[/h2]
Include the beta version, game version, relevant mods and load order, and the steps that reproduce the problem. For Finance shortcuts, say which panel you opened from and which tab appeared. A screenshot or save from before the issue can help reproduce it.

Built against Victoria 3 1.15.2. This is the separate testing distribution of Speculative Markets; it is not Community Mod Framework itself.
